{
  "info": {
    "name": "Workshop API",
    "description": "Complete flow of the Workshop API. Run the requests in order: tokens first, then the work order flow. Set webhookSecret (kubectl get secret budget-webhook) before using the webhook request. See docs/api/openapi.json for the full contract.",
